{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14798","headline":"詶李端长安寓居偶咏见寄 · 卢纶","name":"詶李端长安寓居偶咏见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"自别前峰隐，同爲外累侵。\n几年亲酒会，此日有僧寻。\n学稼功还弃，论边事亦沈。\n衆欢徒满目，专爱久离心。\n览鬓丝垂镜，弹琴泪洒襟。\n访田悲洛下，寄宅忆山阴。\n薄溜漫青石，横云架碧林。\n坏檐藤障密，衰菜棘篱深。\n流散俱多故，忧伤并在今。\n唯当竢高躅，归止共抽簪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢纶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14798.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14798","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}